+
+## NorCal continuous-page integration
+
+`public/norcal-embed.js` reports the natural page height only to the approved NorCal parent after an origin-checked handshake. The parent provides its viewport height so viewport-sized sections do not grow with the iframe. Resize, font and image changes update the height automatically. Standalone visits retain their normal layout. Run `node --test tests/norcal-embed.test.mjs` before release. Publish this support before the NorCal parent integration. No content or artwork changes are required.
